          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa ukafwa; ukarikwa makaburinyi gha weke ndee, Mzinyi ghwa wawae Daudi; mwana wake Jehoshafati ukabonya nguma wulalo ghwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
