              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha mwana wa Ahija, kichuku cha Isakari, ukam'bonyera Nadabu sheshe na kum'bwagha iji uo na masikari ghake werekoghe wikighulaliria muzi ghwa Gibethoni, ugho ghorekoghe ghwa Wafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
