          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shwa wori nyuma ya kuwuya mzuri ukabwagha wandu wose wa kinyumba cha Jeroboamu. Ukawitotesha wose kuseko na kusigha ungi wawo uko moyo, kunughana na ilagho ja BWANA orejighorieghe kwa momu ghwa mdumiki wake mlodi Ahija Mshiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
